{"ref":"BDB, כַּרְמְלִי","hw":"כַּרְמְלִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְמְלִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong>, c. art., <strong>the Carmelite</strong>, of Nabal <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.5\">1 S 30:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 2:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.2.2\">2 S 2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.3\">3:3</a>, so also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.3\">1 S 27:3</a> (𝔊 We Klo Dr Bu Kit; MT <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכַּרְמְלִית</span>, of Abigail); of <span dir=\"rtl\">חצרו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:35\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.35\">2 S 23:35</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.37\">1 Ch 11:37</a>. <strong>f.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">הַכַּרְמְלִית</span> <em>the Carmelitess</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.1\">1 Ch 3:1</a>, of Abigail.","next":"BDB, כַּרְמִיל","prev":"BDB, כַּרְמֶל²"}